Here’s a clean README.md file you can include with your script. It explains usage, dependencies, and installation clearly for QBX Core + ox_lib setup.

🚗 Vehicle Info Command (QBX Core + ox_lib)

A simple Vehicle Information command for QBX Core servers using ox_lib context menu.
This script allows players to view their current vehicle information such as:

Number Plate

Fuel Level

Engine Health

Body Health

All information is displayed using a clean ox_lib context menu UI.

✅ Features

Shows vehicle information using ox_lib context menu

Fuel percentage display

Engine health percentage

Body health percentage

Progress bars with color indicators

Error notification if player is not inside a vehicle

Lightweight and optimized

📦 Dependencies

This script requires the following resources:

QBX Core

ox_lib

lc_fuel (for fuel reading)